{"id": "34452", "title": "好吃娘子", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34452.htm", "intro": "臭豆腐！就为了帮恐怖的小嫂子买臭豆腐，英俊潇洒的傅子翔就此跟既可爱又狡猾的「大胃王」──池光光对上了！为了抢每个月只有三天营业的限量臭豆腐，他被她骗、被她咬、被她绊到水沟里去！哪有姑娘会为了吃而变得这么可怕的？他可真是见识到了！但……他好像就喜欢看她一口吞掉所有食物后的快乐模样──所以明知有阴谋，还是陪她参加了「喜洋洋美食团」，因为能到各地巡回吃尽拉面、野炊、麻辣臭豆腐等等美食是她的梦想，而为了博她一笑，他也只得使出浑身解数加入这场美食大混战罗！……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34452", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2186724.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186726.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186730.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2186748